    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>A Diagnostics System is a series of sensors and simple computers that monitor both the armor and its wearer. Anyone making a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> check on the armor or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> check on its wearer gains a +2 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus from the Diagnostics System. </p>",
